Camera logins and passwords are in `credentials.csv`. Send it separately from this file.

## Important: control

Only **one** ground station with MAVLink system ID 255 should be connected
to a UGV's MAVLink at a time. The UGV watches its heartbeat: if the link to
it is lost for {{ failsafe_s }} s, the UGV stops (Hold mode).

If several operators need to control the UGVs and hand them over to each
other, we can install our stack on your server (control arbiter, video
fan-out, journal) in Docker - it takes 1 vCPU / 1 GB RAM.
